ed Alcazar missions that occurred before the events of our game...\n\nMake sure to [i][b]like[\/b][\/i] the trailer and [i][b]subscribe[\/b][\/i] to our channel on [url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@choosegamename\"][u][b]YouTube[\/b][\/u][\/url]![\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]Steam Scream Fest V[\/b] is currently live! [\/h3][p]Now's the perfect time to play our [b]free demo![\/b] ([i]or perhaps even purchase the [b]full game[\/b][\/i])[i] [\/i]\u02d0steamhappy\u02d0[\/p][p][\/p][p][dynamiclink href=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/2562390\/Bennys_Backrooms\/\"][\/dynamiclink][\/p][p]Find some fellow recruits to play with in our [b]online co-op[\/b] lobbies and have a frightful Halloween in the Backrooms...\n\n[b]Good luck out there![\/b]\n\n[i]\u2013 The GameName Team[\/i][\/p]","commentcount":1,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_487176015_1793310053_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"571553273173166739","event_gid":"667254765243074433","voteupcount":10,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"571553273173166739","rtime32_last_modified":1793329339,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793310054,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793307201,"votes_up":10,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"832747107402331561","gidfeature2":"571553273173166739"},{"gid":"667254131059072631","clan_steamid":"103582791474543031","event_name":"Benny's Backrooms Early Access Released!","event_type":10,"appid":2562390,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793118540,"rtime32_end_time":1793122201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"It's Time to Play...\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,nul